#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:5
#: d87ad87b31144ea4b6c40de9a23e26a1
msgid "BlueOS Live Video Setup"
msgstr "BlueOS 实时视频设置"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:7
#: cc33c36cbf3140139e986532850df91f
msgid ""
"BlueOS supports live video visible in `Cockpit "
"<https://blueos.cloud/cockpit/docs/stable/usage/overview/>`__, Mission "
"Planner and QGC ground stations.  This page explains the setup assuming "
":ref:`this setup <companion-computer-blueos-install>` has already been "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"BlueOS 支持在 `Cockpit "
"<https://blueos.cloud/cockpit/docs/stable/usage/overview/>`__、Mission "
"Planner 和 QGC 地面站中查看实时视频。本页说明设置步骤，前提是已完成 :ref:`此设置 <companion-computer-"
"blueos-install>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:9
#: ee13d0e4ba574c86af656e28c085a770
msgid ""
"`BlueOS's official wiki is here "
"<https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/overview/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`BlueOS 官方 wiki 请见此处 <https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/overview/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:12
#: 6946716bc33948d8b50d222d093438a2
msgid "Video Manager for Cockpit"
msgstr "适用于 Cockpit 的视频管理器"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:14
#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:48
#: 5cb7442ddd374584a82fdac8945dbe9c ccfe008055a84a8ea8afcfd43cc124ac
msgid "Power on the vehicle and wait about 1 minute to allow BlueOS to start"
msgstr "给飞行器上电，等待约 1 分钟使 BlueOS 启动"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:15
#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:49
#: b432fde2e874432fa959d7dc14a73c31 e3bbe0b8749e4763a1b7891dc3c21b0c
msgid ""
"On the PC, open a chrome browser and connect to BlueOs running on the "
"vehicle by entering the vehicle's IP address (see :ref:`4G/LTE telemetry "
"setup <companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem>`) or try http://blueos-"
"wifi.local/"
msgstr ""
"在 PC 上，打开 Chrome 浏览器，通过输入飞行器 IP 地址（参见 :ref:`4G/LTE 数传设置 <companion-computer-"
"blueos-lte-telem>`）或尝试 http://blueos-wifi.local/ 连接到飞行器上运行的 BlueOS"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:16
#: 1fa51ce5883b4079987594ee80567759
msgid "From the left menu select \"Video Streams\""
msgstr "从左侧菜单选择「视频流」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:18
#: ef2765ae311742aea552a7bfa864d385
msgid "under \"Redirect source\" push the \"Add Stream\" button"
msgstr "在「重定向源」下点击「添加流」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:20
#: 1abda21beff4421fa96512a8f50e917e
msgid "Set the \"Stream nickname\" to something like \"Siyi A8\" (anything is fine)"
msgstr "将「流昵称」设置为类似「Siyi A8」的名称（任意名称均可）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:21
#: 84a0ebe620044846b5639151bf06f859
msgid "From the lower-left drop-down change select \"RTSP\""
msgstr "在左下角下拉菜单中选择「RTSP」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:22
#: 214363dc426d4de6b61ff144be55eb0f
msgid ""
"Under \"Stream endpoint\" enter the RTSP URL for your camera.  Please refer "
"to the :ref:`ArduPilot wiki page for your camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals>` and check the \"Ethernet Connectivity\" section.  For the Siyi A8 "
"it is normally ``rtsp://192.168.144.25:8554/main.264``"
msgstr ""
"在「流端点」下输入摄像头的 RTSP URL。请参阅 :ref:`摄像头云台的 ArduPilot wiki 页面 <common-cameras-"
"and-gimbals>` 中的「以太网连接」章节。对于 Siyi A8，通常为 "
"``rtsp://192.168.144.25:8554/main.264``"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:23
#: 805ac7d6bf514678b9bd8782980bc89e
msgid "Push \"Create\""
msgstr "点击「创建」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:25
#: d041d80be36a4f57b5d24621597d67aa
msgid "after a few seconds a thumbnail from the camera may be displayed"
msgstr "几秒后可能显示摄像头缩略图"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:27
#: aeb0611ede234ec38b2f146d7cc27ee9
msgid "From the left menu select \"Cockpit\""
msgstr "从左侧菜单选择「Cockpit」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:29
#: 166e9d843ed046bb8eaa80cb6a15e3fc
msgid ""
"Expose the configuration menu by pushing the arrow button in the middle left"
" of the screen"
msgstr "点击屏幕左侧中部的箭头按钮展开配置菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:30
#: e05a4ed530df47beb5622d8b25ebcc20
msgid "Select Settings, Video"
msgstr "选择「设置」、「视频」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:32
#: 94bb3b324c2b4b1f9b824553b634465e
msgid ""
"At the top under \"Streams mapping\" the video stream should be visible with"
" a \"Status\" of \"Available\""
msgstr "顶部「流映射」下应能看到视频流，「状态」显示为「可用」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:33
#: 7a255ff1633d4782acefee97b6ed34d9
msgid ""
"Check the \"Allowed WebRTC remote IP addresses\" field and delete any IP "
"addresses shown"
msgstr "检查「允许的 WebRTC 远程 IP 地址」字段，并删除其中显示的所有 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:39
#: 14abcabf2ab04e64920fac41d1acc0e7
msgid "Return to the top of the configuration menu and select \"Edit Interface\""
msgstr "返回配置菜单顶部，选择「编辑界面」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:40
#: fd0b2ac6570447928378b53dec488253
msgid ""
"Find \"Video Player\" from the bottom row of icons (this may require "
"scrolling down with the mouse) and drag it to the desired location on the "
"map"
msgstr "从底部图标行找到「视频播放器」（可能需要向下滚动），将其拖动到地图上期望的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:41
#: 006757f200cd492c92069de793807510
msgid ""
"`More information on the WebRTC Video Player can be found here "
"<https://blueos.cloud/cockpit/docs/stable/usage/advanced/#webrtc-video-"
"player>`__"
msgstr ""
"`有关 WebRTC 视频播放器的更多信息请见此处 "
"<https://blueos.cloud/cockpit/docs/stable/usage/advanced/#webrtc-video-"
"player>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:44
#: 0bba7f8042124b2383a6bd1f4e71bcfc
msgid "RTSP Relay for Mission Planner and QGC"
msgstr "适用于 Mission Planner 和 QGC 的 RTSP 中继"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:46
#: d9822a7dad9849d798c70da8cc3309ef
msgid ""
"To view the live video in Mission Planner or QGC, the RTSP Relay (aka "
"MediaMTX) extension must be configured"
msgstr "要在 Mission Planner 或 QGC 中查看实时视频，必须配置 RTSP 中继（即 MediaMTX）扩展"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:50
#: 732dd85e058b43508675342305ce87d4
msgid ""
"From the left menu select \"Extensions\", find MediaMTX and push the \"Get\""
" button"
msgstr "从左侧菜单选择「扩展」，找到 MediaMTX 并点击「获取」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:51
#: 4b0a7f3202124f1b8d97ce20ce02f54f
msgid "From the left menu select \"RTSP Relay\""
msgstr "从左侧菜单选择「RTSP 中继」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:52
#: aa637c2e06fb49d28af2bd2f2ddfed7c
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the code below into the \"MediaMTX Configuration\" section, "
"making sure to set the \"source:\" field to the RTSP URL appropriate for "
"your camera.  This can be found on the :ref:`ArduPilot wiki page for your "
"camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` in the \"Ethernet Connectivity\""
" section"
msgstr ""
"将以下代码复制粘贴到「MediaMTX 配置」部分，并确保将「source:」字段设置为适合您摄像头的 RTSP URL。可在 :ref:`摄像头云台的"
" ArduPilot wiki 页面 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` 的「以太网连接」章节中找到"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:88
#: b9eee5367fcf46868829f308b2c53d01
msgid ""
"Optionally adjust the video resolution and frame rate by changing the "
"\"scale=640:360,fps=10\" portion of the line starting with \"ffmpeg\""
msgstr "可选地通过修改以「ffmpeg」开头的行中的「scale=640:360,fps=10」部分来调整视频分辨率和帧率"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:89
#: f58728463c5f48f4b7db5d29b702dcd0
msgid ""
"This creates two streams either of which may be viewed in Mission Planner or"
" QGC.  If using ZeroTier, the <vehicle_ip> will have been set during the "
":ref:`4G/LTE setup <companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem>`"
msgstr ""
"这将创建两个流，均可在 Mission Planner 或 QGC 中查看。如果使用 ZeroTier，<vehicle_ip> 将在 "
":ref:`4G/LTE 设置 <companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem>` 中设定"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:91
#: 54e836958b2e4f5f93049f2b1dd02a8f
msgid "rtsp://<vehicle_ip>:8555/input (full resolution and frame rate)"
msgstr "rtsp://<vehicle_ip>:8555/input（全分辨率和帧率）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:92
#: 1799775571cc4cc5a0f24b000d9159ff
msgid "rtsp://<vehicle_ip>:8555/compressed (lower bandwidth)"
msgstr "rtsp://<vehicle_ip>:8555/compressed（较低带宽）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-live-video.rst:94
#: a17aed74928640c3bcfc9f405987a299
msgid ""
"`See here for more information on displaying live video in Mission Planner "
"<https://ardupilot.org/planner/docs/live-video.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`有关在 Mission Planner 中显示实时视频的更多信息请见此处 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/planner/docs/live-video.html>`__"
